# Raw county crop rasters — 314 MB of scaffolding downloaded once to build pulse-regions.json
# (88 KB). The derived grid is the evidence; the rasters are re-fetchable from CropScape and
# have no business in a repository that deploys on every commit.
assets/data/archive/cdl-county-cache/

# The yield index is withheld until it corroborates with the canopy it claims to track.
# On 15 September 2026 it disagreed with measured greenness by a median 18.9 points and
# pointed the wrong way in 2 of 7 regions. Two regions matched to within a point, so the
# method is not wrong in principle — but it does not ship until all seven do.
assets/data/yield-index-2026.json
